+Depositing non-fungible tokens (NEP-171)
+The Verifier contract implements the
+NonFungibleTokenReceiver
+interface (
+NEP-171
+standard).
+To transfer NFTs to the Verifier, use
+nft_transfer_call
+with the same
+msg
+format rules as fungible tokens.
+​
+Depositing multi tokens (NEP-245)
+The Verifier contract implements the
+MultiTokenReceiver
+interface (
+NEP-245
+standard).
+To deposit multi tokens, use
+mt_batch_transfer_call
+with the same
+msg
+format rules as fungible tokens.
